    "detailed_description": "Explore the roads of Europe and deliver with Tuck Tow Simulator Europe various broken cars across the continent while driving legendary European trucks! This game takes you on a journey through immersive landscapes and rich environments!<br />\r\nDo you think you have what it takes to be a trucker? Try out your abilities by pushing your skill and performance to the limits! This game features a big open world map, based in Europe! The game includes top graphics and visuals, realistic physics and amazing sound effects! Be a driver of one of the many trucks available, Get behind the wheel and experience the game for yourself!!!<br />\r\nKEY FEATURES:<br />\r\n- Explore the open world map of Europe<br />\r\n- Legendary European trucks!<br />\r\n- Deliever cars from parking point to service!<br />\r\n- High quality graphics and visuals!<br />\r\n- Immersive landscapes!<br />\r\n- Realistic physics and sound design!",
